                     table(5).

             mmaaiill--ffrroomm _m_a_i_l_a_d_d_r
                     Use _m_a_i_l_a_d_d_r as the MAIL FROM address within the SMTP
                     transaction.

             ssrrcc _s_o_u_r_c_e_a_d_d_r | <_s_o_u_r_c_e_a_d_d_r>
                     Use the string or list table _s_o_u_r_c_e_a_d_d_r for the source IP
                     address, which is useful on machines with multiple inter‐
                     faces.  If the list contains more than one address, all
                     of them are used in such a way that traffic is routed as
                     efficiently as possible.

